  "description": "<p>This area rug features a unique Bigfoot design, bringing a touch of the wild outdoors and adventure into your home. It combines durability and comfort with a non-slip backing, making it a functional yet cozy addition to any room. Ideal for nature lovers, this rug adds rustic charm and personality to living spaces.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a detailed Sasquatch design for a unique aesthetic.</li>\n<li>Offers a comfortable and soft surface underfoot.</li>\n<li>Equipped with a non-slip backing for enhanced safety.</li>\n<li>Easy to clean for low maintenance and practical use.</li>\n<li>Adds rustic charm and personality to various rooms.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine-Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Living Room, Bedroom, Cabin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Outdoor Adventure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Rustic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Text Input</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Regular vacuuming or gentle washing</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile area rug is suitable for various indoor settings, including living rooms, bedrooms, and cabins. Its durable and comfortable nature makes it a fitting accent for any space needing a touch of rustic charm and adventure.</p>",
